Malis and Dad go shopping. They buy meat at the butcher and flowers at the florist for Mum. Dad buys a hammer at the hardware shop. Malis needs new trainers from the sports shop. They go to the chemist for medicine. Malis pays with a ten-dollar banknote at the toy shop. The clothes shop is closed.

